+/*
+ * QUSB2 PHY bring-up, following phy-qcom-qusb2.c for the sm6115 table with
+ * the msm8996 register layout: reset, hold disabled, board sequence from the
+ * device tree, enable, single-ended reference clock, wait for PLL lock.
